Yeah, but you can also just bless a stack of 16 blank scrolls.  Those
will last longer than the marker does as often as not, and generally
by the time you get a magic marker, you'll have at least that many
useless scrolls. (The OP's specific game isn't really relevant anymore
since he died.)  Then you still have the option of writing on a
cursed scroll if you want reverse genocide or something.



